shirt</li>\n<li>A belt</li>\n<li>\nA tie</li></ul>Women should wear:\n<ul><li>\nTrousers or a skirt (by the knee)</li>\n<li>\nA blouse</li>\n<li>\nLight makeup</li></ul><br/>", "id": 3, "time": "13000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">What should I not wear?</span> <br/>Men or women should not wear:\n<ul><li>\nJeans</li>\n<li>\nDirty or ripped clothing</li>\n<li>\nLots of makeup</li></ul><br/>", "id": 4, "time": "32000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Why should I not wear these?</span> <br/>You should not wear casual wear because it is important to dress professionally in formal wear. <ul><li>\nBuy a few interview outfits.</li>\n<li>\nRemember to check the company's dress code.</li>\n<li>\nWear the correct attire. </li></ul>", "id": 5, "time": "42500", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn2le08ob07re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}